6. Subqueries and Complex Queries
Task 16: Find all bands that have albums released after 2015
sqlSELECT DISTINCT b.name AS band_name
FROM bands b
JOIN albums a ON b.id = a.band_id
WHERE a.release_year > 2015;
Expected Outcome:
| band_name        |
|------------------|
| Seventh Wonder   |
| Within Temptation|
